  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK-Brazil-Africa Triangular Cooperation Mechanisms for agricultural research, development and innovation for people, nature and climate</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This scoping study will provide FCDO and other government departments with information, analysis, evidence and options to develop a mechanism to support UK-Brazil-Africa Triangular Cooperation for agricultural research, development and innovation for people, nature and climate. Findings from this study will be useful and relevant for FCDO&#x2019;s Africa Technology and Innovation Partnerships (ATIP) program which seeks to accelerate use of innovation in dealing with global challenges that matter most for people, planet and prosperity.</narrative>
  </description>
